{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/ae05c3703e6033fdf5a1351d83c73e61.poster.avif?t=1764389843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/ae05c3703e6033fdf5a1351d83c73e61.webm?t=1764389843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/ae05c3703e6033fdf5a1351d83c73e61.mp4?t=1764389843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolated in your apartment for years the days blend together as you slowly forget the world outside your door. Visions of people you've known begin to plague you through increasingly worse hallucinations.  Explore and live through each day in your apartment and face your past. You must remember their faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Dead Faces is a psychological horror about hallucinations and facing your past taking you through a journey into Jack's mind and unveiling memories revisiting places such as his childhood home and the hospital where his father Arthur passed away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel Jack's disturbing mind, the faces from his past and the truth behind his actions. In Dead Faces, the act of remembering may be the key to redemption or the final step toward madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/f5904f8232402dfc4dceddfc84bd682d.poster.avif?t=1764389843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/f5904f8232402dfc4dceddfc84bd682d.webm?t=1764389843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/f5904f8232402dfc4dceddfc84bd682d.mp4?t=1764389843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Selectable Chapters:</strong> Access each chapter through mirrors in Jack\u2019s decaying apartment, each focused on a person from his past and a different location tied to his memories. Uncover the truth behind his fractured mind in a 4\u20135 hour journey through psychological madness and hallucinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Dynamic Hallucination System:</strong> Experience unpredictable scares as objects morph, spaces distort, and reality bends differently with every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Realism:</strong> Explore realistic atmospheric nightmarish locations from Jack's memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Apartment Hub:</strong>\u00a0Revisit Jack's everchanging apartment after each chapter as it further decays and twists reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Audio Pooling System:</strong>\u00a0The game never sounds the same and chooses from a large pool of audio randomly to keep the player paranoid throughout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Storytelling:</strong> A story-rich psychological descent with multiple endings told through visual storytelling, dynamic events, and surreal progression instead of traditional objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themes:</strong> Themes of Depression, Hallucinations, Suicide, Isolation and a moody nightmarish atmosphere throughout the entire game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: